{"n":32,"name":"As-Sajdah","nameAr":"السجدة","meaning":"The Prostration","ayahs":30,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":21,"ar":"الٓمٓ","en":"Alif, Lām, Meem.","w":[{"ar":"الٓمٓ","tr":"alif-lam-meem","en":"Alif Lam Meem"}]},{"n":2,"juz":21,"ar":"تَنزِيلُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهِ مِن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en":"[This is] the revelation of the Book about which there is no doubt from the Lord of the worlds.","w":[{"ar":"تَنزِيلُ","tr":"tanzīlu","en":"(The) revelation","root":"نزل","lem":"تَنزِيل"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"l-kitābi","en":"(of) the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(there is) no"},{"ar":"رَيْبَ","tr":"rayba","en":"doubt","root":"ريب","lem":"رَيْب"},{"ar":"فِيهِ","tr":"fīhi","en":"about it"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّ","tr":"rabbi","en":"(the) Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tr":"l-ʿālamīna","en":"(of) the worlds","root":"علم","lem":"عالَم"}]},{"n":3,"juz":21,"ar":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۚ بَلْ هُوَ ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكَ لِتُنذِرَ قَوْمًا مَّآ أَتَىٰهُم مِّن نَّذِيرٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَهْتَدُونَ","en":"Or do they say, \"He invented it\"? Rather, it is the truth from your Lord, [O Muḥammad], that you may warn a people to whom no warner has come before you [so] perhaps they will be guided.","w":[{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"Or"},{"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","tr":"yaqūlūna","en":"(do) they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۚ","tr":"if'tarāhu","en":"He invented it","root":"فري","lem":"افْتَرَى"},{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","tr":"l-ḥaqu","en":"(is) the truth","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"لِتُنذِرَ","tr":"litundhira","en":"that you may warn","root":"نذر","lem":"أَنذَرَ"},{"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","tr":"qawman","en":"a people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"مَّآ","tr":"mā","en":"not"},{"ar":"أَتَىٰهُم","tr":"atāhum","en":"has come to them","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"نَّذِيرٍۢ","tr":"nadhīrin","en":"warner","root":"نذر","lem":"نَذِير"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"before you"},{"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","tr":"qablika","en":"before you","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","tr":"laʿallahum","en":"so that they may"},{"ar":"يَهْتَدُونَ","tr":"yahtadūna","en":"be guided","root":"هدي","lem":"اهْتَدَى"}]},{"n":4,"juz":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٍ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ مَا لَكُم مِّن دُونِهِۦ مِن وَلِىٍّ وَلَا شَفِيعٍ ۚ أَفَلَا تَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en":"It is Allāh who created the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them in six days; then He established Himself above the Throne. You have not besides Him any protector or any intercessor; so will you not be reminded?","w":[{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"al-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"(is) the One Who"},{"ar":"خَلَقَ","tr":"khalaqa","en":"created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","tr":"wal-arḍa","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","tr":"baynahumā","en":"(is) between them","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"سِتَّةِ","tr":"sittati","en":"six","root":"ستت","lem":"سِتَّة"},{"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","tr":"ayyāmin","en":"periods","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ","tr":"is'tawā","en":"established Himself","root":"سوي","lem":"اسْتَوَى"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ","tr":"l-ʿarshi","en":"the Throne","root":"عرش","lem":"عَرْش"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"لَكُم","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"besides Him"},{"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","tr":"dūnihi","en":"besides Him","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"وَلِىٍّۢ","tr":"waliyyin","en":"protector","root":"ولي","lem":"وَلِيّ"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"شَفِيعٍ ۚ","tr":"shafīʿin","en":"any intercessor","root":"شفع","lem":"شَفِيع"},{"ar":"أَفَلَا","tr":"afalā","en":"Then will not"},{"ar":"تَتَذَكَّرُونَ","tr":"tatadhakkarūna","en":"you take heed","root":"ذكر","lem":"تَذَكَّرَ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":21,"ar":"يُدَبِّرُ ٱلْأَمْرَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ ثُمَّ يَعْرُجُ إِلَيْهِ فِى يَوْمٍ كَانَ مِقْدَارُهُۥٓ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ مِّمَّا تَعُدُّونَ","en":"He arranges [each] matter from the heaven to the earth; then it will ascend to Him in a Day, the extent of which is a thousand years of those which you count.","w":[{"ar":"يُدَبِّرُ","tr":"yudabbiru","en":"He regulates","root":"دبر","lem":"يُدَبِّرُ"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرَ","tr":"l-amra","en":"the affair","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the heaven","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"يَعْرُجُ","tr":"yaʿruju","en":"it will ascend","root":"عرج","lem":"يَعْرُجُ"},{"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","tr":"ilayhi","en":"to Him"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"يَوْمٍۢ","tr":"yawmin","en":"a Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"(the) measure of which is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مِقْدَارُهُۥٓ","tr":"miq'dāruhu","en":"(the) measure of which is","root":"قدر","lem":"مِقْدار"},{"ar":"أَلْفَ","tr":"alfa","en":"a thousand","root":"ألف","lem":"أَلْف"},{"ar":"سَنَةٍۢ","tr":"sanatin","en":"years","root":"سنو","lem":"سَنَة"},{"ar":"مِّمَّا","tr":"mimmā","en":"of what"},{"ar":"تَعُدُّونَ","tr":"taʿuddūna","en":"you count","root":"عدد","lem":"عَدَّ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":21,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ عَـٰلِمُ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en":"That is the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,","w":[{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"عَـٰلِمُ","tr":"ʿālimu","en":"(is the) Knower","root":"علم","lem":"عالِم"},{"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","tr":"l-ghaybi","en":"(of) the hidden","root":"غيب","lem":"غَيْب"},{"ar":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","tr":"wal-shahādati","en":"and the witnessed","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهادَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","tr":"l-ʿazīzu","en":"the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","tr":"l-raḥīmu","en":"the Most Merciful","root":"رحم","lem":"رَحِيم"}]},{"n":7,"juz":21,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَحْسَنَ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ ۖ وَبَدَأَ خَلْقَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنِ مِن طِينٍ","en":"Who perfected everything which He created and began the creation of man from clay.","w":[{"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","tr":"alladhī","en":"The One Who"},{"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","tr":"aḥsana","en":"made good","root":"حسن","lem":"أَحْسَنَ"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍ","tr":"shayin","en":"thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"خَلَقَهُۥ ۖ","tr":"khalaqahu","en":"He created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"وَبَدَأَ","tr":"wabada-a","en":"and He began","root":"بدأ","lem":"بَدَأَ"},{"ar":"خَلْقَ","tr":"khalqa","en":"(the) creation","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلْق"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنِ","tr":"l-insāni","en":"(of) man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"طِينٍۢ","tr":"ṭīnin","en":"clay","root":"طين","lem":"طِين"}]},{"n":8,"juz":21,"ar":"ثُمَّ جَعَلَ نَسْلَهُۥ مِن سُلَـٰلَةٍ مِّن مَّآءٍ مَّهِينٍ","en":"Then He made his posterity out of the extract of a liquid disdained.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"جَعَلَ","tr":"jaʿala","en":"He made","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"نَسْلَهُۥ","tr":"naslahu","en":"his progeny","root":"نسل","lem":"نَسْل"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"سُلَـٰلَةٍۢ","tr":"sulālatin","en":"an extract","root":"سلل","lem":"سُلالَة"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"مَّآءٍۢ","tr":"māin","en":"water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"مَّهِينٍۢ","tr":"mahīnin","en":"despised","root":"مهن","lem":"مَهِين"}]},{"n":9,"juz":21,"ar":"ثُمَّ سَوَّىٰهُ وَنَفَخَ فِيهِ مِن رُّوحِهِۦ ۖ وَجَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلسَّمْعَ وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ وَٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةَ ۚ قَلِيلًا مَّا تَشْكُرُونَ","en":"Then He proportioned him and breathed into him from His [created] soul and made for you hearing and vision and hearts [i.e., intellect]; little are you grateful.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"سَوَّىٰهُ","tr":"sawwāhu","en":"He fashioned him","root":"سوي","lem":"سَوَّى"},{"ar":"وَنَفَخَ","tr":"wanafakha","en":"and breathed","root":"نفخ","lem":"نَفَخَ"},{"ar":"فِيهِ","tr":"fīhi","en":"into him"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رُّوحِهِۦ ۖ","tr":"rūḥihi","en":"His spirit","root":"روح","lem":"رُوح"},{"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","tr":"wajaʿala","en":"and made","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمُ","tr":"lakumu","en":"for you"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمْعَ","tr":"l-samʿa","en":"the hearing","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمْع"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ","tr":"wal-abṣāra","en":"and the sight","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصَر"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةَ ۚ","tr":"wal-afidata","en":"and feelings","root":"فأد","lem":"فُؤاد"},{"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","tr":"qalīlan","en":"little","root":"قلل","lem":"قَلِيل"},{"ar":"مَّا","tr":"mā","en":"[what]"},{"ar":"تَشْكُرُونَ","tr":"tashkurūna","en":"thanks you give","root":"شكر","lem":"شَكَرَ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":21,"ar":"وَقَالُوٓا۟ أَءِذَا ضَلَلْنَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ أَءِنَّا لَفِى خَلْقٍ جَدِيدٍۭ ۚ بَلْ هُم بِلِقَآءِ رَبِّهِمْ كَـٰفِرُونَ","en":"And they say, \"When we are lost [i.e., disintegrated] within the earth, will we indeed be [recreated] in a new creation?\" Rather, they are, in the meeting with their Lord, disbelievers.","w":[{"ar":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","tr":"waqālū","en":"And they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"أَءِذَا","tr":"a-idhā","en":"Is (it) when"},{"ar":"ضَلَلْنَا","tr":"ḍalalnā","en":"we are lost","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضَلَّ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"أَءِنَّا","tr":"a-innā","en":"will we"},{"ar":"لَفِى","tr":"lafī","en":"certainly be in"},{"ar":"خَلْقٍۢ","tr":"khalqin","en":"a creation","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلْق"},{"ar":"جَدِيدٍۭ ۚ","tr":"jadīdin","en":"new","root":"جدد","lem":"جَدِيد"},{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"هُم","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"بِلِقَآءِ","tr":"biliqāi","en":"in (the) meeting","root":"لقي","lem":"لِقاء"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"(of) their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","tr":"kāfirūna","en":"(are) disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"}]},{"n":11,"juz":21,"ar":"۞ قُلْ يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم مَّلَكُ ٱلْمَوْتِ ٱلَّذِى وُكِّلَ بِكُمْ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ تُرْجَعُونَ","en":"Say, \"The angel of death who has been entrusted with you will take you. Then to your Lord you will be returned.\"","w":[{"ar":"۞ قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","tr":"yatawaffākum","en":"Will take your soul","root":"وفي","lem":"تَوَفَّى"},{"ar":"مَّلَكُ","tr":"malaku","en":"(the) Angel","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَك"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتِ","tr":"l-mawti","en":"(of) the death","root":"موت","lem":"مَوْت"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"the one who"},{"ar":"وُكِّلَ","tr":"wukkila","en":"has been put in charge","root":"وكل","lem":"وُكِّلَ"},{"ar":"بِكُمْ","tr":"bikum","en":"of you"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَبِّكُمْ","tr":"rabbikum","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"تُرْجَعُونَ","tr":"tur'jaʿūna","en":"you will be returned","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجَعَ"}]},{"n":12,"juz":21,"ar":"وَلَوْ تَرَىٰٓ إِذِ ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ نَاكِسُوا۟ رُءُوسِهِمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ رَبَّنَآ أَبْصَرْنَا وَسَمِعْنَا فَٱرْجِعْنَا نَعْمَلْ صَـٰلِحًا إِنَّا مُوقِنُونَ","en":"If you could but see when the criminals are hanging their heads before their Lord, [saying], \"Our Lord, we have seen and heard, so return us [to the world]; we will work righteousness. Indeed, we are [now] certain.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَلَوْ","tr":"walaw","en":"And if"},{"ar":"تَرَىٰٓ","tr":"tarā","en":"you (could) see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"إِذِ","tr":"idhi","en":"when"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","tr":"l-muj'rimūna","en":"the criminals","root":"جرم","lem":"مُجْرِم"},{"ar":"نَاكِسُوا۟","tr":"nākisū","en":"(will) hang","root":"نكس","lem":"ناكِسُوا"},{"ar":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","tr":"ruūsihim","en":"their heads","root":"رأس","lem":"رَأْس"},{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"before","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","tr":"rabbanā","en":"Our Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"أَبْصَرْنَا","tr":"abṣarnā","en":"we have seen","root":"بصر","lem":"أَبْصَرَ"},{"ar":"وَسَمِعْنَا","tr":"wasamiʿ'nā","en":"and we have heard","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"فَٱرْجِعْنَا","tr":"fa-ir'jiʿ'nā","en":"so return us","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجَعَ"},{"ar":"نَعْمَلْ","tr":"naʿmal","en":"we will do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰلِحًا","tr":"ṣāliḥan","en":"righteous (deeds)","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِح"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, we"},{"ar":"مُوقِنُونَ","tr":"mūqinūna","en":"(are now) certain","root":"يقن","lem":"مُوقِن"}]},{"n":13,"juz":21,"ar":"وَلَوْ شِئْنَا لَـَٔاتَيْنَا كُلَّ نَفْسٍ هُدَىٰهَا وَلَـٰكِنْ حَقَّ ٱلْقَوْلُ مِنِّى لَأَمْلَأَنَّ جَهَنَّمَ مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ أَجْمَعِينَ","en":"And if We had willed, We could have given every soul its guidance, but the word from Me will come into effect [that] \"I will surely fill Hell with jinn and people all together.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَوْ","tr":"walaw","en":"And if"},{"ar":"شِئْنَا","tr":"shi'nā","en":"We (had) willed","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"لَـَٔاتَيْنَا","tr":"laātaynā","en":"surely We (would) have given","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"every","root":"كلل","