? They are not equal.","w":[{"ar":"أَفَمَن","tr":"afaman","en":"Then is one who"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","tr":"mu'minan","en":"a believer","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"},{"ar":"كَمَن","tr":"kaman","en":"like (him) who"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"فَاسِقًۭا ۚ","tr":"fāsiqan","en":"defiantly disobedient","root":"فسق","lem":"فاسِق"},{"ar":"لَّا","tr":"lā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"يَسْتَوُۥنَ","tr":"yastawūna","en":"they are equal","root":"سوي","lem":"اسْتَوَى"}]},{"n":19,"juz":21,"ar":"أَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ فَلَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتُ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ نُزُلًۢا بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en":"As for those who believed and did righteous deeds, for them will be the Gardens of Refuge as accommodation for what they used to do.","w":[{"ar":"أَمَّا","tr":"ammā","en":"As for"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","tr":"waʿamilū","en":"and do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","tr":"l-ṣāliḥāti","en":"righteous deeds","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِحَة"},{"ar":"فَلَهُمْ","tr":"falahum","en":"then for them"},{"ar":"جَنَّـٰتُ","tr":"jannātu","en":"(are) Gardens","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","tr":"l-mawā","en":"(of) Refuge","root":"أوي","lem":"مَأْوَى"},{"ar":"نُزُلًۢا","tr":"nuzulan","en":"(as) hospitality","root":"نزل","lem":"نُزُل"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"for what"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they used (to)","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","tr":"yaʿmalūna","en":"do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"}]},{"n":20,"juz":21,"ar":"وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ فَسَقُوا۟ فَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ ٱلنَّارُ ۖ كُلَّمَآ أَرَادُوٓا۟ أَن يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنْهَآ أُعِيدُوا۟ فِيهَا وَقِيلَ لَهُمْ ذُوقُوا۟ عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ ٱلَّذِى كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","en":"But as for those who defiantly disobeyed, their refuge is the Fire. Every time they wish to emerge from it, they will be returned to it while it is said to them, \"Taste the punishment of the Fire which you used to deny.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"But as for"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"فَسَقُوا۟","tr":"fasaqū","en":"are defiantly disobedient","root":"فسق","lem":"فَسَقَ"},{"ar":"فَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","tr":"famawāhumu","en":"then their refuge","root":"أوي","lem":"مَأْوَى"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","tr":"l-nāru","en":"(is) the Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"كُلَّمَآ","tr":"kullamā","en":"Every time","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلَّما"},{"ar":"أَرَادُوٓا۟","tr":"arādū","en":"they wish","root":"رود","lem":"أَرادَ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"to"},{"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","tr":"yakhrujū","en":"come out","root":"خرج","lem":"خَرَجَ"},{"ar":"مِنْهَآ","tr":"min'hā","en":"from it"},{"ar":"أُعِيدُوا۟","tr":"uʿīdū","en":"they (will) be returned","root":"عود","lem":"أُعِيدُ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"in it"},{"ar":"وَقِيلَ","tr":"waqīla","en":"and it (will) be said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"to them"},{"ar":"ذُوقُوا۟","tr":"dhūqū","en":"Taste","root":"ذوق","lem":"ذاقُ"},{"ar":"عَذَابَ","tr":"ʿadhāba","en":"(the) punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","tr":"l-nāri","en":"(of) the Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"which"},{"ar":"كُنتُم","tr":"kuntum","en":"you used (to)","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"[in it]"},{"ar":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","tr":"tukadhibūna","en":"deny","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"}]},{"n":21,"juz":21,"ar":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم مِّنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ٱلْأَدْنَىٰ دُونَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ٱلْأَكْبَرِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ","en":"And We will surely let them taste the nearer punishment short of the greater punishment that perhaps they will return [i.e., repent].","w":[{"ar":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم","tr":"walanudhīqannahum","en":"And surely, We will let them taste","root":"ذوق","lem":"أَذاقَ"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","tr":"l-ʿadhābi","en":"the punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَدْنَىٰ","tr":"l-adnā","en":"the nearer","root":"دنو","lem":"أَدْنَى"},{"ar":"دُونَ","tr":"dūna","en":"before","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","tr":"l-ʿadhābi","en":"the punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَكْبَرِ","tr":"l-akbari","en":"the greater","root":"كبر","lem":"أَكْبَر"},{"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","tr":"laʿallahum","en":"so that they may"},{"ar":"يَرْجِعُونَ","tr":"yarjiʿūna","en":"return","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجَعَ"}]},{"n":22,"juz":21,"ar":"وَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّن ذُكِّرَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِۦ ثُمَّ أَعْرَضَ عَنْهَآ ۚ إِنَّا مِنَ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ مُنتَقِمُونَ","en":"And who is more unjust than one who is reminded of the verses of his Lord; then he turns away from them? Indeed We, from the criminals, will take retribution.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَنْ","tr":"waman","en":"And who"},{"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","tr":"aẓlamu","en":"(is) more unjust","root":"ظلم","lem":"أَظْلَم"},{"ar":"مِمَّن","tr":"mimman","en":"than (he) who"},{"ar":"ذُكِّرَ","tr":"dhukkira","en":"is reminded","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذُكِّرَ"},{"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","tr":"biāyāti","en":"of (the) Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ","tr":"rabbihi","en":"(of) his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"أَعْرَضَ","tr":"aʿraḍa","en":"he turns away","root":"عرض","lem":"أَعْرَضَ"},{"ar":"عَنْهَآ ۚ","tr":"ʿanhā","en":"from them"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","tr":"l-muj'rimīna","en":"the criminals","root":"جرم","lem":"مُجْرِم"},{"ar":"مُنتَقِمُونَ","tr":"muntaqimūna","en":"(will) take retribution","root":"نقم","lem":"مُنتَقِم"}]},{"n":23,"juz":21,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَى ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ فَلَا تَكُن فِى مِرْيَةٍ مِّن لِّقَآئِهِۦ ۖ وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ هُدًى لِّبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en":"And We certainly gave Moses the Scripture, so do not be in doubt over his meeting. And We made it [i.e., the Torah] guidance for the Children of Israel.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","tr":"ātaynā","en":"We gave","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"مُوسَى","tr":"mūsā","en":"Musa"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","tr":"l-kitāba","en":"the Scripture","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"so (do) not"},{"ar":"تَكُن","tr":"takun","en":"be","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","tr":"mir'yatin","en":"doubt","root":"مري","lem":"مِرْيَة"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"about"},{"ar":"لِّقَآئِهِۦ ۖ","tr":"liqāihi","en":"receiving it","root":"لقي","lem":"لِقاء"},{"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ","tr":"wajaʿalnāhu","en":"And We made it","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"هُدًۭى","tr":"hudan","en":"a guide","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"لِّبَنِىٓ","tr":"libanī","en":"for the Children of Israel","root":"بني","lem":"بُنَىّ"},{"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","tr":"is'rāīla","en":"for the Children of Israel"}]},{"n":24,"juz":21,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا مِنْهُمْ أَئِمَّةً يَهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِنَا لَمَّا صَبَرُوا۟ ۖ وَكَانُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا يُوقِنُونَ","en":"And We made from among them leaders guiding by Our command when they were patient and [when] they were certain of Our signs.","w":[{"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","tr":"wajaʿalnā","en":"And We made","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"from them"},{"ar":"أَئِمَّةًۭ","tr":"a-immatan","en":"leaders","root":"أمم","lem":"إِمام"},{"ar":"يَهْدُونَ","tr":"yahdūna","en":"guiding","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"بِأَمْرِنَا","tr":"bi-amrinā","en":"by Our Command","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟ ۖ","tr":"ṣabarū","en":"they were patient","root":"صبر","lem":"صَبَرَ"},{"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","tr":"wakānū","en":"and they were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","tr":"biāyātinā","en":"of Our Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"يُوقِنُونَ","tr":"yūqinūna","en":"certain","root":"يقن","lem":"يُوقِنُ"}]},{"n":25,"juz":21,"ar":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ يَفْصِلُ بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en":"Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"رَبَّكَ","tr":"rabbaka","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"[He]"},{"ar":"يَفْصِلُ","tr":"yafṣilu","en":"will judge","root":"فصل","lem":"فَصَلَ"},{"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","tr":"baynahum","en":"between them","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(on the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","tr":"l-qiyāmati","en":"(of) Resurrection","root":"قوم","lem":"قِيامَة"},{"ar":"فِيمَا","tr":"fīmā","en":"in what"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they used (to)","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"فِيهِ","tr":"fīhi","en":"[in it]"},{"ar":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","tr":"yakhtalifūna","en":"differ","root":"خلف","lem":"اخْتَلَفَ"}]},{"n":26,"juz":21,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ يَهْدِ لَهُمْ كَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا مِن قَبْلِهِم مِّنَ ٱلْقُرُونِ يَمْشُونَ فِى مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ ۖ أَفَلَا يَسْمَعُونَ","en":"Has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them, [as] they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs; then do they not hear?","w":[{"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","tr":"awalam","en":"Does it not"},{"ar":"يَهْدِ","tr":"yahdi","en":"guide","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"[for] them"},{"ar":"كَمْ","tr":"kam","en":"(that) how many"},{"ar":"أَهْلَكْنَا","tr":"ahlaknā","en":"We have destroyed","root":"هلك","lem":"أَهْلَكَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"before them"},{"ar":"قَبْلِهِم","tr":"qablihim","en":"before them","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","tr":"l-qurūni","en":"the generations","root":"قرن","lem":"قَرْن"},{"ar":"يَمْشُونَ","tr":"yamshūna","en":"they walk about","root":"مشي","lem":"مَشَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۚ","tr":"masākinihim","en":"their dwellings","root":"سكن","lem":"مَسْكَن"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ ۖ","tr":"laāyātin","en":"surely, are Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"أَفَلَا","tr":"afalā","en":"Then do not"},{"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","tr":"yasmaʿūna","en":"they hear","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"}]},{"n":27,"juz":21,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا نَسُوقُ ٱلْمَآءَ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ ٱلْجُرُزِ فَنُخْرِجُ بِهِۦ زَرْعًا تَأْكُلُ مِنْهُ أَنْعَـٰمُهُمْ وَأَنفُسُهُمْ ۖ أَفَلَا يُبْصِرُونَ","en":"Have they not seen that We drive water [in clouds] to barren land and bring forth thereby crops from which their livestock eat and [they] themselves? Then do they not see?","w":[{"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","tr":"awalam","en":"Do not"},{"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","tr":"yaraw","en":"they see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"أَنَّا","tr":"annā","en":"that We"},{"ar":"نَسُوقُ","tr":"nasūqu","en":"drive","root":"سوق","lem":"سِيقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَآءَ","tr":"l-māa","en":"water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the land","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"ٱلْجُرُزِ","tr":"l-juruzi","en":"[the] barren","root":"جرز","lem":"جُرُز"},{"ar":"فَنُخْرِجُ","tr":"fanukh'riju","en":"then We bring forth","root":"خرج","lem":"أَخْرَجَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"thereby"},{"ar":"زَرْعًۭا","tr":"zarʿan","en":"crops","root":"زرع","lem":"زَرْع"},{"ar":"تَأْكُلُ","tr":"takulu","en":"eat","root":"أكل","lem":"أَكَلَ"},{"ar":"مِنْهُ","tr":"min'hu","en":"from it"},{"ar":"أَنْعَـٰمُهُمْ","tr":"anʿāmuhum","en":"their cattle","root":"نعم","lem":"نَعَم"},{"ar":"وَأَنفُسُهُمْ ۖ","tr":"wa-anfusuhum","en":"and they themselves","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"أَفَلَا","tr":"afalā","en":"Then do not"},{"ar":"يُبْصِرُونَ","tr":"yub'ṣirūna","en":"they see","root":"بصر","lem":"أَبْصَرَ"}]},{"n":28,"juz":21,"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَـٰذَا ٱلْفَتْحُ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en":"And they say, \"When will be this conquest, if you should be truthful?\"","w":[{"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","tr":"wayaqūlūna","en":"And they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"مَتَىٰ","tr":"matā","en":"When (will be)"},{"ar":"هَـٰذَا","tr":"hādhā","en":"this"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَتْحُ","tr":"l-fatḥu","en":"decision","root":"فتح","lem":"فَتْح"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"كُنتُمْ","tr":"kuntum","en":"you are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","tr":"ṣādiqīna","en":"truthful","root":"صدق","lem":"صادِق"}]},{"n":29,"juz":21,"ar":"قُلْ يَوْمَ ٱلْفَتْحِ لَا يَنفَعُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِيمَـٰنُهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُنظَرُونَ","en":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"On the Day of Conquest the belief of those who had disbelieved will not benefit them, nor will they be reprieved.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(On the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَتْحِ","tr":"l-fatḥi","en":"(of) the Decision","root":"فتح","lem":"فَتْح"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَنفَعُ","tr":"yanfaʿu","en":"will benefit","root":"نفع","lem":"نَفَعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"إِيمَـٰنُهُمْ","tr":"īmānuhum","en":"their belief","root":"أمن","lem":"إِيمان"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"يُنظَرُونَ","tr":"yunẓarūna","en":"will be granted respite","root":"نظر","lem":"يُنظَرُ"}]},{"n":30,"juz":21,"ar":"فَأَعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ وَٱنتَظِرْ إِنَّهُم مُّنتَظِرُونَ","en":"So turn away from them and wait. Indeed, they are waiting.","w":[{"ar":"فَأَعْرِضْ","tr":"fa-aʿriḍ","en":"So turn away","root":"عرض","lem":"أَعْرَضَ"},{"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","tr":"ʿanhum","en":"from them"},{"ar":"وَٱنتَظِرْ","tr":"wa-intaẓir","en":"and wait","root":"نظر","lem":"يَنتَظِرُ"